<title>CHINA: China forex market to close for Labour Day.</title>
<headline>China forex market to close for Labour Day.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai-based China Foreign Exchange Trade System, an interbank market, will close from Thursday to Saturday for the Labour Day holiday, an exchange official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Sunday, the official said.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Chinese yuan closed weaker at 8.2948 against the U.S. dollar from Tuesday's 8.2938.</p>
